{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls5_jpg\\math\\007.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Numbers up to 1Million", "conf": 0.875, "box": [[302, 190], [671, 194], [670, 228], [302, 224]]}, {"text": "There are about 391,000 types", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[211, 297], [526, 299], [526, 325], [211, 323]]}, {"text": "of plants in the world. How can", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[210, 325], [524, 321], [524, 348], [210, 352]]}, {"text": "we write this number in words?", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[208, 353], [526, 349], [526, 372], [208, 376]]}, {"text": "To denote place values, we learnt that commas are put after", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[95, 514], [704, 501], [705, 532], [95, 544]]}, {"text": "every 3 digits, from the right.", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[95, 548], [381, 541], [382, 568], [95, 575]]}, {"text": "downloaded from awazeinqilab.com", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[14, 566], [47, 566], [44, 1068], [12, 1068]]}, {"text": "We can also denote this by putting spaces after every 3", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[94, 577], [700, 566], [701, 596], [94, 607]]}, {"text": "digits, from the right. For example 391,000 becomes 391 000.", "conf": 0.938, "box": [[95, 608], [756, 593], [757, 623], [95, 639]]}, {"text": "The number 391 000 can be read as \"Three hundred and", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[97, 678], [681, 667], [682, 694], [97, 704]]}, {"text": "ninety-one thousand\".", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[97, 711], [319, 704], [320, 732], [97, 738]]}, {"text": "We know that 999,999 is the greatest 6-digit", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[79, 800], [524, 796], [524, 823], [79, 827]]}, {"text": "00000", "conf": 0.709, "box": [[666, 809], [791, 809], [791, 833], [666, 833]]}, {"text": "number. If we add 1 to it, we get one million;", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[79, 835], [530, 828], [530, 854], [79, 861]]}, {"text": "999,999", "conf": 0.865, "box": [[656, 830], [809, 830], [809, 858], [656, 858]]}, {"text": "(1,000,000) which is the smallest 7-digit", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[80, 867], [480, 858], [481, 886], [80, 894]]}, {"text": "number. 1,000,000 is the smallest 7-digit", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[77, 898], [488, 892], [489, 918], [77, 924]]}, {"text": "1,000,0000", "conf": 0.835, "box": [[635, 907], [808, 907], [808, 934], [635, 934]]}, {"text": "number.", "conf": 0.873, "box": [[77, 929], [162, 929], [162, 956], [77, 956]]}, {"text": "We can write this number with the help of a place value chart as", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[81, 986], [825, 981], [825, 1010], [81, 1015]]}, {"text": "shown below.", "conf": 0.858, "box": [[82, 1021], [236, 1024], [235, 1051], [82, 1048]]}, {"text": "Hundred", "conf": 0.873, "box": [[211, 1080], [306, 1077], [307, 1106], [212, 1108]]}, {"text": "Ten", "conf": 0.745, "box": [[369, 1079], [413, 1079], [413, 1106], [369, 1106]]}, {"text": "Tens", "conf": 0.798, "box": [[708, 1089], [764, 1089], [764, 1114], [708, 1114]]}, {"text": "Millions", "conf": 0.802, "box": [[96, 1090], [177, 1094], [176, 1122], [95, 1119]]}, {"text": "Thousands Hundreds", "conf": 0.874, "box": [[456, 1092], [686, 1089], [687, 1115], [456, 1118]]}, {"text": "Ones", "conf": 0.739, "box": [[796, 1087], [861, 1087], [861, 1115], [796, 1115]]}, {"text": "Thousands", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[202, 1106], [325, 1108], [324, 1135], [202, 1133]]}, {"text": "Thousands", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[327, 1107], [450, 1105], [450, 1132], [328, 1134]]}, {"text": "OTFORSALE", "conf": 0.844, "box": [[738, 1309], [881, 1309], [881, 1329], [738, 1329]]}, {"text": "downloaded from awazeinqilab.com", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[178, 1472], [749, 1473], [749, 1509], [178, 1508]]}]}